<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97091" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στράγξ</span></b> , ἡ, gen.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στραγγός</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>trickle, drop</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ
				διὰ λεπτοτάτης ὀπῆς σχολῇ κατιὼν σταλαγμός</span>,
				Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				131
			</span></i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσιτος ἑπτὰ μῆνας, ὕδατος στράγγ᾽
					ἔχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					238
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μικρὰς στράγγας ἀπ᾽ ὠκεανοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					4.1.38
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ στράγγα</span>
			<i>drop by drop</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.18.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				16.750
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>UP</u>
				5.16
			</span></i>. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρᾴγξ </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στράιγξ</span>) is a monosyll. of seven letters
			acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Trypho
			</span></i> ap.Sch.D.T.<i><span class="en">
				p.346
			</span></i> H., but the word is <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στράγξ</span>
			with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ</span> acc. to <i><span class="en">
				<u>An.Ox.</u>
				3.243
			</span></i>.)</div>
